Profiling builds (WASM_ENABLE_PERF_PROFILING) only: who calls one function.
With ISO_WAMR_CALLERS=<its name in the name section> in the environment,
each call's time between two dumps of the profile is counted by the chain
of (up to twelve) functions it was called through, and printed after the
second dump as [wamr-callers] lines. Isomer's, for finding which code
makes the Swift runtime scan its conformances.

